                        "sense_id": "7b33427d-4689-3254-a6fb-5c4c26cbfa40",
                        "entry_id": "27ed0aa4-8d9c-32d8-83f8-bc793d1c6a01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Abbreviation of jump shot."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b6bc492-4735-464b-bf4b-84d0ceba5e05",
                                "sense_id": "7b33427d-4689-3254-a6fb-5c4c26cbfa40",
                                "text": "And Durant had a front seat for just how much work DeRozan was putting in during their time together in Rio. \"I watched him man,\" Durant said. \"His footwork in the post is flawless. His jump shot in the mid-range is incredible. That is the type of stuff I look at as a basketball guy, his footwork, his mechanics on his J, his handle. At first he was a dunker and he barely dunks now. He’s a finesse player but he can play power forward. I’m a big fan.\""
                            }
